FILE: index.rs
MOD: commands/index
OWNS: index compilation — writes arch.index.json + llmcode.index.json to architecture/generated/
PROFILE: [io]
CHANGE-FREQUENCY: stable

run: bool → Result<(), String> [io]
  calls: lmindex::build_arch_index, lmindex::build_llmcode_index, llmcode::discover_llmcode_files

DEPENDS-ON: context, lmindex, llmcode, schema

KEY-INVARIANTS:
- output path is always architecture/generated/ — callers must not rely on cwd-relative paths

